    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "SQL/PGQ 属性图的目录表示与 pg_dump 存在多处缺陷",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 的 SQL/PGQ 属性图在目录层面还很粗糙。Andres Freund 指出属性图不该有 pg_attribute 条目，pg_dump 的依赖追踪也不完整，遗漏属性类型依赖会导致恢复顺序出错，属性图被塞进 dumpTableSchema() 而没有独立处理函数。AI 辅助审查还发现 CASCADE 删除后残留孤立元数据、performDeletion() 缺少缓存失效、图与物化视图的循环依赖无法恢复。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/dqa5mstx5mna3i7s23pdwl4m6bek7gqsgfccef44wjpswizufi@3aa6vzri3cat",
      "author": "Andres Freund",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-08-22",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "SQL/PGQ",
        "pg_dump",
        "PG19"
      ],
      "position": 1
